(6438644, 955855, 125275, '<td valign="top">I wonder if the pants is what makes this really not work for me. That or the focus, or the fact that it''s not clear that it''s honey? Something is making the honey go from "sticky and sweet" to "disgusting and contagious." Imagine not knowing this was a honey challenge and look at the picture again.</td>', 'I wonder if the pants is what makes this really not work for me. That or the focus, or the fact that it''s not clear that it''s honey? Something is making the honey go from "sticky and sweet" to "disgusting and contagious." Imagine not knowing this was a honey challenge and look at the picture again.', '2011-06-08 14:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6438653, 955397, 125275, '<td valign="top">If we finally do run out of bees, I know whose house I''m going to!</td>', 'If we finally do run out of bees, I know whose house I''m going to!', '2011-06-08 14:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
