(6438694, 955901, 125275, '<td valign="top">I''m feeling <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=49109" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">h2</a> on this. Getting reminded of the chocolate icing winner from household items. I mean that kindly, btw. The lighting and clarity is awesome. I imagine you could really take this pic out of the park with advanced editing.</td>', 'I''m feeling  h2 on this. Getting reminded of the chocolate icing winner from household items. I mean that kindly, btw. The lighting and clarity is awesome. I imagine you could really take this pic out of the park with advanced editing.', '2011-06-08 14:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
