(6438701, 954902, 125275, '<td valign="top">I love this pic. Maybe it reminds me of my childhood. Or maybe I love the idea of a honey bear jar "out on the town." In my mental cinema, the bear''s name was called, and he turned around to have the paparazzi snap this image of him before he waved and disappeared to his meanderings. Ha!</td>', 'I love this pic. Maybe it reminds me of my childhood. Or maybe I love the idea of a honey bear jar "out on the town." In my mental cinema, the bear''s name was called, and he turned around to have the paparazzi snap this image of him before he waved and disappeared to his meanderings. Ha!', '2011-06-08 14:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6438703, 955860, 125275, '<td valign="top">The colors on that flower are incredible and I really wish it was more in focus!</td>', 'The colors on that flower are incredible and I really wish it was more in focus!', '2011-06-08 14:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
