(6439235, 955467, 18778, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words- but this I think this image would be more in line with the challenge if the honey was visibly recognizable as such.  Also, the white of the shirt is the most striking contrast against the dark of the hair/fence that it draws my eye far more than the honey.</td>', 'Nice play on words- but this I think this image would be more in line with the challenge if the honey was visibly recognizable as such.  Also, the white of the shirt is the most striking contrast against the dark of the hair/fence that it draws my eye far more than the honey.', '2011-06-08 23:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439237, 955768, 18778, '<td valign="top">Cool lighting and the reflective qualities of the jar have been nicely played.  I also find it interesting that the subject ''has it''s back to the viewer'' if you will...</td>', 'Cool lighting and the reflective qualities of the jar have been nicely played.  I also find it interesting that the subject ''has it''s back to the viewer'' if you will...', '2011-06-08 23:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439246, 955855, 18778, '<td valign="top">This crotch shot feels dirty.  And not in a fun way.  Even the honey jar looks like the off brand high fructose corn syrup that would be served at a chain Mexican food buffet that they strive to pass off as honey ''cause it''s sitting next to the sopapillas. On a more serious note- what''s in focus in this image?</td>', 'This crotch shot feels dirty.  And not in a fun way.  Even the honey jar looks like the off brand high fructose corn syrup that would be served at a chain Mexican food buffet that they strive to pass off as honey ''cause it''s sitting next to the sopapillas. On a more serious note- what''s in focus in this image?', '2011-06-09 00:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439249, 955760, 18778, '<td valign="top">I like the way this image makes me feel like I can ''feel'' the honey.  The thickness of the honey is easily conveyed to the viewer and the light reflecting off it is appealing.  I also find the colors of this image interesting as you kept it clean and almost monochromatic.  My only criticism is that this image doesn''t make me think of the missing bees...</td>', 'I like the way this image makes me feel like I can ''feel'' the honey.  The thickness of the honey is easily conveyed to the viewer and the light reflecting off it is appealing.  I also find the colors of this image interesting as you kept it clean and almost monochromatic.  My only criticism is that this image doesn''t make me think of the missing bees...', '2011-06-09 00:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439250, 955978, 18778, '<td valign="top">I totally dig this more abstract interpretation.  It almost feels like a water color</td>', 'I totally dig this more abstract interpretation.  It almost feels like a water color', '2011-06-09 00:07:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439255, 955951, 129267, '<td valign="top">Not really liking the composition of this, it feels a bit default. I think a different crop might help this image more, as would a little bit more contrast.</td>', 'Not really liking the composition of this, it feels a bit default. I think a different crop might help this image more, as would a little bit more contrast.', '2011-06-09 00:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439256, 955963, 18778, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate this concept- but it feels forced.  IS the kid enjoying this moment?  As a viewer- I want to emotionally connect with the ''joy'' one would experience in this position, but instead I note how he''s biting his tongue and eyeing the bottle- no wish to indulge in the golden nectar.  Also, where is the bee connection?</td>', 'I can appreciate this concept- but it feels forced.  IS the kid enjoying this moment?  As a viewer- I want to emotionally connect with the ''joy'' one would experience in this position, but instead I note how he''s biting his tongue and eyeing the bottle- no wish to indulge in the golden nectar.  Also, where is the bee connection?', '2011-06-09 00:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439257, 955967, 129267, '<td valign="top">This took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at. I can''t say that I terribly like it, it feels quite a bit over sharpened. I can see this being more interesting (to me, not to the voters) without the leaf in it.</td>', 'This took me a minute to figure out what I was looking at. I can''t say that I terribly like it, it feels quite a bit over sharpened. I can see this being more interesting (to me, not to the voters) without the leaf in it.', '2011-06-09 00:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439260, 955953, 18778, '<td valign="top">The rejected cover art for Mariah Carey''s ''Honey'' single...On a more serious note- I find the combination of sex and honey obvious and cliche.  And I fail to see the bee connection.  However- I like the way you can see the the texture within the honey itself and good job capturing the ''drip''  I also like the lines of the image- how the overall image is left justified, yet my eye is drawn to the center/continuous line of the honey.</td>', 'The rejected cover art for Mariah Carey''s ''Honey'' single...On a more serious note- I find the combination of sex and honey obvious and cliche.  And I fail to see the bee connection.  However- I like the way you can see the the texture within the honey itself and good job capturing the ''drip''  I also like the lines of the image- how the overall image is left justified, yet my eye is drawn to the center/continuous line of the honey.', '2011-06-09 00:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439261, 955317, 129267, '<td valign="top">interesting to see the wings in motion. Nicely composed, if not a bit tight of a crop. wouldn''t mind seeing this a bit sharper as well. The most interesting thing to me is the color of the pollen on the rear legs.</td>', 'interesting to see the wings in motion. Nicely composed, if not a bit tight of a crop. wouldn''t mind seeing this a bit sharper as well. The most interesting thing to me is the color of the pollen on the rear legs.', '2011-06-09 00:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
