(6439263, 955525, 129267, '<td valign="top">bokeh is nice, but I can''t actually figure out where the focus is, so I lose interest very quickly. On a side note, that is the most obese looking bee I''ve ever seen. He must be American :P</td>', 'bokeh is nice, but I can''t actually figure out where the focus is, so I lose interest very quickly. On a side note, that is the most obese looking bee I''ve ever seen. He must be American :P', '2011-06-09 00:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
