(6439265, 955910, 125275, '<td valign="top">I think the honey is well lit here. The brightness of the spoon pulls my eye away a bit from the "action" part of the scene, but I think it''s well composed. I wonder how it would look straightened? Also, an interesting use of negative space at the top 3/4 of the image. Me likes.</td>', 'I think the honey is well lit here. The brightness of the spoon pulls my eye away a bit from the "action" part of the scene, but I think it''s well composed. I wonder how it would look straightened? Also, an interesting use of negative space at the top 3/4 of the image. Me likes.', '2011-06-09 00:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439266, 955296, 129267, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I''m liking the processing done here, feels a bit like a bad HDR. The left side of the image is extremely interesting, much more so than the OOF honey jar. I can also see this working well in black and white.</td>', 'I''m not sure I''m liking the processing done here, feels a bit like a bad HDR. The left side of the image is extremely interesting, much more so than the OOF honey jar. I can also see this working well in black and white.', '2011-06-09 00:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439269, 955945, 125275, '<td valign="top">This is less appealing to me because my brain doesn''t tell me it''s honey. It''s not the color of honey. It''s the color of Robitussin. And that tastes like Robitussin.</td>', 'This is less appealing to me because my brain doesn''t tell me it''s honey. It''s not the color of honey. It''s the color of Robitussin. And that tastes like Robitussin.', '2011-06-09 00:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6439270, 955381, 129267, '<td valign="top">love the top right quadrant. wouldn''t mind seeing this image (specfically the bee) a bit brighter in tone. also - love the square crop, works well for this shot.</td>', 'love the top right quadrant. wouldn''t mind seeing this image (specfically the bee) a bit brighter in tone. also - love the square crop, works well for this shot.', '2011-06-09 00:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
