(6439275, 955392, 129267, '<td valign="top">everything seems to be fine, composition, lighting, exposure, but something feels a bit off to me. It seems to be a bit hyper-sharp in places (specifically the flower/stem) which keeps pulling my eyes away.</td>', 'everything seems to be fine, composition, lighting, exposure, but something feels a bit off to me. It seems to be a bit hyper-sharp in places (specifically the flower/stem) which keeps pulling my eyes away.', '2011-06-09 00:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
