(6440645, 955765, 16106, '<td valign="top">I was thinking of what I might shoot for this challenge, and the bee on a honeycomb was my thought; I''m glad I didn''t look for my shot, because this is the ideal version of what I might have shot. The lighting, the framing and the perfect focus is just ideal. The clear blue winner.</td>', 'I was thinking of what I might shoot for this challenge, and the bee on a honeycomb was my thought; I''m glad I didn''t look for my shot, because this is the ideal version of what I might have shot. The lighting, the framing and the perfect focus is just ideal. The clear blue winner.', '2011-06-10 15:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440650, 955901, 16106, '<td valign="top">You did a nice job capturing the glossy reflection of honey. I do wish you had gotten a bit more yellow in the light, because the well lit brown background carries the color of the drip into the dark a bit much, had it glowed a rich honey gold color it would have brought the shot to the next level. As it is it is my pick for red.</td>', 'You did a nice job capturing the glossy reflection of honey. I do wish you had gotten a bit more yellow in the light, because the well lit brown background carries the color of the drip into the dark a bit much, had it glowed a rich honey gold color it would have brought the shot to the next level. As it is it is my pick for red.', '2011-06-10 15:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440672, 955910, 16106, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and background to show off the color of honey, and the pile of honey on the spoon has nice drama, but that drama is so little of the shot and so much is black or spoon that I think a tighter crop would have helped.</td>', 'Nice lighting and background to show off the color of honey, and the pile of honey on the spoon has nice drama, but that drama is so little of the shot and so much is black or spoon that I think a tighter crop would have helped.', '2011-06-10 15:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440676, 955876, 124256, '<td valign="top">Your concept is fantastic, I wish I liked your shot better.  I don''t care for your lighting.  I think the table detracts both in color, texture, angles, shadow (far left), and in contrast with the wall.  The medicine of choice was good, but I think that bottle is far too busy for this shot.  Also, you can''t see enough of the spoon for it to be clear that that is what it is at a glance.  Again, I love your concept, and I think your glass/honey/lemon combo is great.  Scored high.</td>', 'Your concept is fantastic, I wish I liked your shot better.  I don''t care for your lighting.  I think the table detracts both in color, texture, angles, shadow (far left), and in contrast with the wall.  The medicine of choice was good, but I think that bottle is far too busy for this shot.  Also, you can''t see enough of the spoon for it to be clear that that is what it is at a glance.  Again, I love your concept, and I think your glass/honey/lemon combo is great.  Scored high.', '2011-06-10 15:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
