(6440978, 955751, 47470, '<td valign="top">That is so cool!  What a capture!  Were they really holding on/lining up like that or was that just luck in the way they were flying?  Either way, really great shot!</td>', 'That is so cool!  What a capture!  Were they really holding on/lining up like that or was that just luck in the way they were flying?  Either way, really great shot!', '2011-06-10 23:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
