(6440986, 955953, 47470, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit awkward to me.  I think it might have worked better to have the honey dripping over her whole body, as if the honey were caressing her curves (I think that would have made the image a lot more sensual).</td>', 'This seems a bit awkward to me.  I think it might have worked better to have the honey dripping over her whole body, as if the honey were caressing her curves (I think that would have made the image a lot more sensual).', '2011-06-10 23:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440987, 955012, 47470, '<td valign="top">I think a little more sharpening would have gone a long way in bringing out the detail and reaching the potential the image has.</td>', 'I think a little more sharpening would have gone a long way in bringing out the detail and reaching the potential the image has.', '2011-06-10 23:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440994, 955766, 47470, '<td valign="top">The blurriness/haziness reminds me of those days that are so humid that your skin feels as sticky as honey.  Those are the same days when you lounge in the shade of a giant oak tree eating honey with your best friend, scooping the honey out of the jar with your finger : )</td>', 'The blurriness/haziness reminds me of those days that are so humid that your skin feels as sticky as honey.  Those are the same days when you lounge in the shade of a giant oak tree eating honey with your best friend, scooping the honey out of the jar with your finger : )', '2011-06-10 23:49:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6440996, 955901, 47470, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  I particularly like the great rim light on the right side.  I wish there was a little something more to help this stand out besides the great technicals.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  I particularly like the great rim light on the right side.  I wish there was a little something more to help this stand out besides the great technicals.', '2011-06-10 23:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
