(6441489, 955458, 132967, '<td valign="top">Bee pictures are slight difficult to get and I commend you.  However, the focus seems to be more on the flower stem vs. the bee or the flower itself.</td>', 'Bee pictures are slight difficult to get and I commend you.  However, the focus seems to be more on the flower stem vs. the bee or the flower itself.', '2011-06-11 20:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
