(6442611, 955397, 70957, '<td valign="top">Pretty good honey simulation (I assume it''s a sim because that would be an awful lot of honey to be messing with!!). I once shot a friend''s honey products and we needed some more jars for the photo but he was sold out. So he diluted coffee in water and put it in a honey jar and voila, the color was practically the same as the real stuff.</td>', 'Pretty good honey simulation (I assume it''s a sim because that would be an awful lot of honey to be messing with!!). I once shot a friend''s honey products and we needed some more jars for the photo but he was sold out. So he diluted coffee in water and put it in a honey jar and voila, the color was practically the same as the real stuff.', '2011-06-13 05:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
