(6444387, 955895, 131377, '<td valign="top">Weeelllll... I''m not upset over the way this placed, because I have never really cared one way or another. I do wish the challenge guidelines would have been more specific. All I read was: "A tribute to the missing bees." I didn''t see anything that said the picture had to include bees or honey. When I think of bees, I think of flowers. My mistake, I suppose.<br/> <br/>This lilac bush is enourmous.. It is probably ten feet high and it encircles my fiance''s yard. There were no bees that I could see on the entire bush. So, naturally, I thought of how the bees were going missing.. And to me, it fit the challenge. Maybe my brain is a little TOO "different". Oh well. :)</td>', 'Weeelllll... I''m not upset over the way this placed, because I have never really cared one way or another. I do wish the challenge guidelines would have been more specific. All I read was: "A tribute to the missing bees." I didn''t see anything that said the picture had to include bees or honey. When I think of bees, I think of flowers. My mistake, I suppose. This lilac bush is enourmous.. It is probably ten feet high and it encircles my fiance''s yard. There were no bees that I could see on the entire bush. So, naturally, I thought of how the bees were going missing.. And to me, it fit the challenge. Maybe my brain is a little TOO "different". Oh well. :)', '2011-06-15 11:48:40.000000', NULL, 0),
